      "writtenOn": "2022-10-06T19:10:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the comment on the design intention of bluez. I didn\u0027t consider that far. I assumed it is for temporary APIs, like the LL privacy which would be default enabled in the end, so the dbus call call be removed. Need @sonnysasaka@google.com to comment on if it is useful in floss in the long run for other features.",
      "parentUuid": "9a8000b3_18716afd",
      "revId": "25c1cb097d850496ac29e22008c1858eb99c90c6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
